"Subject: Rendering the Great Outdoors: Fast Occlusion Culling for Outdoor
    Environments

URL: http://www.newsisfree.com/click/-0,8613679,159/
Date: 2002-10-06T18:12:41+01:00

Rendering engines used in todays game titles utilize various techniques for 
hidden surface removal (HSR), different techniques being suitable for different 
game genres. For example, action games played in closed-in locations need an 
engine allowing fast rendering of a few hundred polygons, a high frame rate, 
and a high level of details to impress players. Conversely, a game that is 
taking place outdoors requires quite a different approach. This features 
present one one technique for hidden surface removal usable in 3D engines using 
tilizing object occlusion.",subject rendering the great outdoors fast occlusion culling for outdoor environments url httpaddr date num_token num_token 06t18 num_token num_token num_token num_token rendering engines used in todays game titles utilize various techniques for hidden surface removal hsr different techniques being suitable for different game genres for example action games played in closed in locations need an engine allowing fast rendering of a few hundred polygons a high frame rate and a high level of details to impress players conversely a game that is taking place outdoors requires quite a different approach this features present one one technique for hidden surface removal usable in 3d engines using tilizing object occlusion,0,ham
