"Subject: Re: [Razor-users] spamassassin+razor2

On Thu, Sep 05, 2002 at 04:27:08PM -0400, Eugene Chiu wrote:
> razor2 check skipped: Bad file descriptor Insecure dependency in open while runn
> ing setuid at /usr/local/lib/perl5/site_perl/5.6.1/Razor2/Client/Config.pm line
